<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xml:lang="ja" itunes:timing="Word"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="またねがあれば"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="MIREI"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1577315032"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><songwriters><songwriter>ori Sawada</songwriter></songwriters><translations><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-Hans"><text for="L1">回想起来 后悔的事大概也就两件吧</text><text for="L2">生日礼物 似乎送不出去了</text><text for="L3">想穿给你看的衣裳 变得毫无意义了</text><text for="L4">不得不对你说再见这回事</text><text for="L5">啊 这不就是第三件了吗</text><text for="L6">算啦 随它去吧</text><text for="L7">都怪你 我还得收拾这间屋子呢</text><text for="L8">明明都没什么时间了 怎么净给我找事啊</text><text for="L9">可要是等寒冬渐浓 你才提起那件事的话</text><text for="L10">下一次我可就真的要哭出来了</text><text for="L11">选在春天不行吗？</text><text for="L12">不不 迎着融融春意</text><text for="L13">想必连你也开不了口吧</text><text for="L14">那就夏天吧 泪水还能混着汗水一同掩饰过去</text><text for="L15">可是 天气热我又讨厌 还是定在秋天吧</text><text for="L16">——其实 我也就是随口说说啦</text><text for="L17">与你相伴的那三十六个月里</text><text for="L18">半生份的幸福 与一生份的悔恨</text><text for="L19">不断穿透 肆意滋长 盛开出斑白的花</text><text for="L20">难道只有我一人这样觉得吗？</text><text for="L21">与你共同度过的那三十六个月的日日夜夜</text><text for="L22">就是我一辈子的幸福 是绝不会再有的万幸啊</text><text for="L23">这份心意 绝不会改变</text><text for="L24">反正到了明天也会通通丢弃</text><text for="L25">所以先静静点头 现在好好听我说完吧</text><text for="L26">不可思议的是 当那一刻真正降临时 却怎么也哭不出来</text><text for="L27">竟动过用眼泪挽留你的念头 这样的自己真丢人</text><text for="L28">心头的情绪早已漫过悲伤的极限</text><text for="L29">比起眼泪 率先脱口而出的竟是“开什么玩笑”</text><text for="L30">可我心里清楚 在胡闹胡来的……其实是我自己</text><text for="L31">毫无防备的睡颜 寻不见另一只的袜子</text><text for="L32">绝不会说出口的“谢谢” 偶尔送来的一束花</text><text for="L33">从前 我们不一直都是这样生活过来的吗？</text><text for="L34">我们不一直都是这样一路走来的吗？</text><text for="L35">又在讲同样的故事 听过无数遍我也从不觉得厌烦呀</text><text for="L36">白开水般的平淡日子 毫无气泡的情歌</text><text for="L37">即便是索然无味的口香糖 对我来说也足够好了啊</text><text for="L38">与其吐掉 还不如直接咽下去呢……我竟这么想着</text><text for="L39">回想起来 后悔的事大概也就两件吧</text><text for="L40">生日礼物 似乎送不出去了</text><text for="L41">想穿给你看的衣裳 变得毫无意义了</text><text for="L42">啊 还有就是呢</text><text for="L43">恐怕连以朋友身份见一面都做不到了吧</text><text for="L44">在你心中的我 意外地如此渺小</text><text for="L45">想说的话 渴望听你说的话 倾尽所有也道不尽</text><text for="L46">但归结到最后 其实只有那么一句啊</text><text for="L47">那就是——我依然深爱着你</text><text for="L48">你所留下的那整整三年回忆</text><text for="L49">便是我一生份的幸福 是我一生份的幸福</text><text for="L50">若还有“下一次”多好……我如此徒劳地挣扎着</text><text for="L51">全都是你给予我的啊 无论说多少遍都道不尽感恩</text><text for="L52">是一生份的幸福 是无可置疑的眷顾</text><text for="L53">虽然我还说不习惯 虽然我们再也不会有“下次见”了</text><text for="L54">最后就由我主动对你说出一声“谢谢”吧</text><text for="L55">你也笑一笑吧</text><text for="L56">求你……笑一笑啊</text><text for="L57">笑一笑嘛……求你了</text><text for="L58">生怕气氛变得沉重而故作轻松说出的</text><text for="L59">那流于表面的道别</text><text for="L60">全都毫无意义啊</text><text for="L61">那就再见啦</text><text for="L62">真的再见啦</text><text for="L63">再见啦……</text></translation></translations></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="6:19.214"><div begin="0:01.013" end="6:19.214"><p begin="0:01.013" end="0:04.783" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:01.013" end="0:01.343">思</span><span begin="0:01.343" end="0:01.483">え</span><span begin="0:01.483" end="0:01.633">ば</span><span begin="0:01.633" end="0:02.403">後悔</span><span begin="0:02.403" end="0:02.573">は、</span><span begin="0:02.573" end="0:02.903">二</span><span begin="0:02.903" end="0:03.103">つ</span><span begin="0:03.103" end="0:03.323">く</span><span begin="0:03.323" end="0:03.553">ら</span><span begin="0:03.553" end="0:03.823">いし</span><span begin="0:03.823" end="0:03.963">か</span><span begin="0:03.963" end="0:04.233">な</span><span begin="0:04.233" end="0:04.383">い</span><span begin="0:04.383" end="0:04.783">な</span></p><p begin="0:06.963" end="0:11.713" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:06.963" end="0:07.713">誕生</span><span begin="0:07.713" end="0:07.843">日</span><span begin="0:07.843" end="0:08.093">プ</span><span begin="0:08.093" end="0:08.243">レ</span><span begin="0:08.243" end="0:08.453">ゼ</span><span begin="0:08.453" end="0:08.633">ン</span><span begin="0:08.633" end="0:08.813">ト</span><span begin="0:08.813" end="0:09.013">が、</span><span begin="0:09.013" end="0:09.313">渡</span><span begin="0:09.313" end="0:09.503">せ</span><span begin="0:09.503" end="0:09.913">そう</span><span begin="0:09.913" end="0:10.163">に</span><span begin="0:10.163" end="0:10.503">な</span><span begin="0:10.503" end="0:10.773">い</span><span begin="0:10.773" end="0:10.963">こ</span><span begin="0:10.963" end="0:11.713">と</span></p><p begin="0:12.902" end="0:18.122" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:12.902" end="0:13.012">あ</span><span begin="0:13.012" end="0:13.172">な</span><span begin="0:13.172" end="0:13.402">た</span><span begin="0:13.402" end="0:13.572">に</span><span begin="0:13.572" end="0:13.702">見</span><span begin="0:13.702" end="0:13.902">せ</span><span begin="0:13.902" end="0:14.142">た</span><span begin="0:14.142" end="0:14.482">かっ</span><span begin="0:14.482" end="0:14.752">た</span><span begin="0:14.752" end="0:15.172">服</span><span begin="0:15.172" end="0:15.352">が、</span><span begin="0:15.552" end="0:16.012">無駄</span><span begin="0:16.012" end="0:16.222">に</span><span begin="0:16.222" end="0:16.672">な</span><span begin="0:16.672" end="0:16.942">って</span><span begin="0:16.942" end="0:17.132">し</span><span begin="0:17.132" end="0:17.442">ま</span><span begin="0:17.442" end="0:17.702">った</span><span begin="0:17.702" end="0:17.892">こ</span><span begin="0:17.892" end="0:18.122">と</span></p><p begin="0:18.459" end="0:20.919" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:18.459" end="0:18.669">さ</span><span begin="0:18.669" end="0:18.899">よ</span><span begin="0:18.899" end="0:19.089">な</span><span begin="0:19.089" end="0:19.189">ら</span><span begin="0:19.189" end="0:19.459">し</span><span begin="0:19.459" end="0:19.589">な</span><span begin="0:19.589" end="0:19.869">きゃ</span><span begin="0:19.869" end="0:19.969">い</span><span begin="0:19.969" end="0:20.179">け</span><span begin="0:20.179" end="0:20.389">な</span><span begin="0:20.389" end="0:20.499">い</span><span begin="0:20.499" end="0:20.699">こ</span><span begin="0:20.699" end="0:20.919">と</span></p><p begin="0:21.338" end="0:23.098" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:21.338" end="0:21.598">あぁ、</span><span begin="0:21.598" end="0:21.858">こ</span><span begin="0:21.858" end="0:22.008">れ</span><span begin="0:22.008" end="0:22.178">で</span><span begin="0:22.178" end="0:22.378">三</span><span begin="0:22.378" end="0:22.698">つ</span><span begin="0:22.698" end="0:22.868">め</span><span begin="0:22.868" end="0:23.098">か</span></p><p begin="0:23.465" end="0:24.345" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:23.465" end="0:23.855">まあ</span><span begin="0:23.855" end="0:23.965">い</span><span begin="0:23.965" end="0:24.115">っ</span><span begin="0:24.115" end="0:24.345">か</span></p><p begin="0:36.263" end="0:40.623" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:36.263" end="0:36.393">あ</span><span begin="0:36.393" end="0:36.553">な</span><span begin="0:36.553" end="0:36.763">た</span><span begin="0:36.763" end="0:36.883">の</span><span begin="0:36.883" end="0:37.313">せい</span><span begin="0:37.313" end="0:37.643">で、</span><span begin="0:37.643" end="0:38.083">部屋</span><span begin="0:38.083" end="0:38.213">を</span><span begin="0:38.213" end="0:38.553">片</span><span begin="0:38.553" end="0:38.783">さ</span><span begin="0:38.783" end="0:38.933">な</span><span begin="0:38.933" end="0:39.103">きゃ</span><span begin="0:39.103" end="0:39.533">な</span><span begin="0:39.533" end="0:39.673">ら</span><span begin="0:39.673" end="0:40.113">な</span><span begin="0:40.113" end="0:40.233">い</span><span begin="0:40.233" end="0:40.623">よ</span></p><p begin="0:42.119" end="0:46.439" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:42.119" end="0:42.249">あ</span><span begin="0:42.249" end="0:42.449">ま</span><span begin="0:42.449" end="0:42.579">り</span><span begin="0:42.579" end="0:43.159">時間</span><span begin="0:43.159" end="0:43.319">が</span><span begin="0:43.319" end="0:43.569">な</span><span begin="0:43.569" end="0:43.709">い</span><span begin="0:43.709" end="0:43.919">の</span><span begin="0:43.919" end="0:44.219">に、</span><span begin="0:44.799" end="0:45.029">な</span><span begin="0:45.029" end="0:45.179">ん</span><span begin="0:45.179" end="0:45.319">て</span><span begin="0:45.319" end="0:45.509">こ</span><span begin="0:45.509" end="0:45.669">と</span><span begin="0:45.669" end="0:45.929">す</span><span begin="0:45.929" end="0:46.149">ん</span><span begin="0:46.149" end="0:46.439">だ</span></p><p begin="0:47.946" end="0:53.296" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:47.946" end="0:48.126">で</span><span begin="0:48.126" end="0:48.296">も</span><span begin="0:48.296" end="0:48.656">冬</span><span begin="0:48.656" end="0:48.826">が</span><span begin="0:48.826" end="0:48.996">濃</span><span begin="0:48.996" end="0:49.276">く</span><span begin="0:49.276" end="0:49.466">な</span><span begin="0:49.466" end="0:49.566">っ</span><span begin="0:49.566" end="0:49.776">て、</span><span begin="0:49.776" end="0:50.176">そ</span><span begin="0:50.176" end="0:50.326">ん</span><span begin="0:50.326" end="0:50.466">な</span><span begin="0:50.656" end="0:51.446">話</span><span begin="0:51.446" end="0:51.566">を</span><span begin="0:51.566" end="0:51.876">切</span><span begin="0:51.876" end="0:52.116">り</span><span begin="0:52.116" end="0:52.246">出</span><span begin="0:52.246" end="0:52.636">さ</span><span begin="0:52.636" end="0:52.836">れ</span><span begin="0:52.836" end="0:53.106">た</span><span begin="0:53.106" end="0:53.296">ら</span></p><p begin="0:53.564" end="0:56.024" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:53.564" end="0:53.944">次</span><span begin="0:53.944" end="0:54.104">こ</span><span begin="0:54.104" end="0:54.344">そ</span><span begin="0:54.344" end="0:54.514">は</span><span begin="0:54.514" end="0:54.724">泣</span><span begin="0:54.724" end="0:54.854">い</span><span begin="0:54.854" end="0:55.004">て</span><span begin="0:55.004" end="0:55.174">し</span><span begin="0:55.174" end="0:55.444">ま</span><span begin="0:55.444" end="0:55.564">う</span><span begin="0:55.564" end="0:55.844">か</span><span begin="0:55.844" end="0:56.024">ら</span></p><p begin="0:56.509" end="0:58.209" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:56.509" end="0:56.899">春</span><span begin="0:56.899" end="0:57.089">じゃ</span><span begin="0:57.259" end="0:57.359">ダ</span><span begin="0:57.359" end="0:57.649">メ</span><span begin="0:57.649" end="0:57.809">で</span><span begin="0:57.809" end="0:57.979">す</span><span begin="0:57.979" end="0:58.209">か</span></p><p begin="0:59.271" end="1:04.201" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:59.271" end="0:59.481">い</span><span begin="0:59.481" end="0:59.881">や</span><span begin="1:00.061" end="1:00.221">い</span><span begin="1:00.221" end="1:00.571">や、</span><span begin="1:00.571" end="1:01.321">春</span><span begin="1:01.321" end="1:01.611">の</span><span begin="1:01.611" end="1:02.161">陽気</span><span begin="1:02.161" end="1:02.391">に</span><span begin="1:02.391" end="1:02.521">中</span><span begin="1:02.521" end="1:02.961">て</span><span begin="1:02.961" end="1:03.141">ら</span><span begin="1:03.141" end="1:03.391">れ</span><span begin="1:03.391" end="1:03.591">た</span><span begin="1:03.591" end="1:04.201">ら</span></p><p begin="1:05.006" end="1:10.116" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:05.006" end="1:06.026">流石</span><span begin="1:06.026" end="1:06.456">の</span><span begin="1:06.626" end="1:07.186">あな</span><span begin="1:07.186" end="1:07.506">た</span><span begin="1:07.506" end="1:07.676">も、</span><span begin="1:07.916" end="1:08.216">言い</span><span begin="1:08.216" end="1:08.366">に</span><span begin="1:08.366" end="1:08.666">く</span><span begin